<title>POLAND: BIG SEPT NET FALLS TO PLN 3.7 MLN.</title>
<headline>BIG SEPT NET FALLS TO PLN 3.7 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> SEPTEMBER					   1996	 1995</p>
<p> Net profit					  3.70 vs   10.06</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    3.70 vs    5.73</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 15.56 vs   24.28</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	28.32 vs   42.71</p>
<p> JANUARY-SEPTEMBER				 1996	 1995</p>
<p> Net profit					 55.23 vs   60.61</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   55.23 vs   75.15</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		172.75 vs  147.33</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     447.78 vs  335.09</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Incjatyw</p>
<p>Gospodarczych SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
